# Ferrite model manifest, read by scripts/fetch-models.sh.
#   @ <folder> <repo> <revision> <role>   one line per model repository (folder = name under $FERRITE_MODELS)
#   <folder> <file> <bytes> <sha256>      every file that is verified after the download
# The NVFP4 and DFlash2 entries are the pinned upstream revisions (their safetensors hashes equal the Hub's LFS
# sha256). The EXL3 entries describe the quant as it is uploaded: its folder as Ferrite was tested with it, README.md =
# docs/model-card.md and a sha256sums.txt. scripts/hf-upload.sh stages that set and checks it against these lines
# (--update-manifest rewrites them after the model card changes); pin the uploaded revision here.
# The XQ entries (role xq) are the quant of the Intel Arc Pro B70 engine, staged the same way by
# scripts/hf-upload.sh --xq with README.md = docs/model-card-xq.md; scripts/fetch-models.sh fetches it only by name.
